          "description": "Backend Engineer | Early-Stage Fintech | Remote US\nJoin a high-growth fintech startup building products that expand access to credit and financial opportunity for millions of Americans.\nThe opportunity\nOwn backend systems end-to-end, from architecture through production and scaling\nBuild reliable, high-performance APIs and infrastructure\nWork with a modern Node.js, TypeScript, and AWS stack\nLeverage AI-assisted development tools to ship faster without compromising code quality\nJoin a lean, high-performing team with significant ownership and impact\nWhat we're looking for\n5+ years of software engineering experience, with a strong backend focus\nHands-on experience building production systems with Node.js and AWS\nStrong systems thinking, architectural judgment, and a focus on reliability and scalability\nA track record of shipping high-quality software quickly\nExcitement about AI-assisted development and taking ownership in a fast-paced startup environment\nWhy join?\nHigh ownership, minimal bureaucracy, meaningful impact, and the opportunity to help scale a rapidly growing business backed by leading venture investors.\nInterested? Send me a message to learn more.",
          "source_url": ""
        }
