          "description": "5. Lumicera\nFrontend Developer\n$130 K\nfully Remote\nA frontend-focused engineer responsible for developing modern, responsive, maintainable user interfaces for enterprise healthcare and pharmacy applications. This individual should be very strong in React and comfortable integrating frontend applications with .NET-based backend services.\nMust-have technical skills\nStrong hands-on React development.\nJavaScript and TypeScript.\nReact Hooks, functional components, and state management.\nREST API integration and handling asynchronous data.\nHTML, CSS, responsive layouts, and reusable components.\nFrontend debugging, performance optimization, and testing.\nAbility to work independently on complex user interfaces.\nPreferred: Redux or Context API, React Testing Library, Jest, CI/CD, healthcare applications, and basic C#/.NET knowledge.",
