          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚀 We’re Hiring: Full Stack Developer\n\nAce On Technology is looking for a Full Stack Developer with 1.5–3 years of professional experience to join our growing team!\n\n📍 Location: Gulistan-e-Johar, Karachi — Onsite\n📅 Working Days: Monday to Saturday\n💼 Employment Type: Full-time\n💻 Experience Required: 1.5–3 Years\n\nRequired Skills: \nStrong hands-on experience with Node.js and Express.js\nProficiency in React.js\nGood understanding of JavaScript and TypeScript\nExperience working with MongoDB\nExperience with Browser/Chrome Extensions will be a strong plus.\n\n⚠️ Please Note: This is an onsite position in Karachi. We encourage applications only from candidates who are currently residing in Karachi or are willing to relocate to Karachi.\n\n📌 Before applying, please read the complete Job Description carefully and ensure your skills and experience align with the requirements.\n\n📩 How to Apply: \n\nInterested candidates can DM me directly or send their CV to hr@aceontechnology.com.\n\nPlease mention the following along with your CV:\n\n💰 Current Salary\n💵 Expected Salary\n📅 Notice Period\n\nIf you know someone who would be a good fit, feel free to tag them or share this post.🚀\n\n#Hiring #FullStackDeveloper #NodeJS #ReactJS #TypeScript #MongoDB #KarachiJobs #TechJobs #PakistanJobs #OnsiteJobs #SoftwareJobs #AceOnTechnology",
