        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "🚀 We are Hiring!!!!\n\nPosition: Node.js Developer\nExperience: Fresh – 1 Year\n\n📍 Location: DHA Phase 2 Ext, Karachi.\n\nResponsibilities:\n\nDevelop and maintain backend applications using Node.js\nBuild and integrate REST APIs\nDebug and troubleshoot application issues\nCollaborate with development teams\nWork with databases and third-party integrations\n\nRequirements:\n\nBachelor’s degree in Computer Science or related field\nGood understanding of JavaScript and Node.js\nFamiliarity with Express.js and REST APIs\nBasic knowledge of MongoDB/MySQL\nUnderstanding of Git/version control is a plus\nGood problem-solving and communication skills\n\n📩 Interested candidates can share their resumes at hira.wahid@cee-solutions.com or hr@resourcelinked.tech with the position mentioned in the subject line",
